    ] .

<https://meta.linked.archi/basic/metamodel> a dcat:Dataset;
  dcterms:title "Linked.Archi Basic Metamodel Definition"@en;
  dcterms:description """Metamodel manifest for Basic, a minimal Linked.Archi modelling
language. This file ties together the Basic semantic resources (the element and relationship
ontology, the SKOS taxonomy, the presentation contexts and the default notation set) into a
single arch:Metamodel instance.

This is the entry point for tools that need to discover all resources that make up the Basic
language definition."""@en;
