<https://meta.linked.archi/cloud-services/onto> a dcat:Dataset;
  dcterms:title "Linked.Archi Cloud Services Extension"@en;
  dcterms:description """Classifies the elements of any model that stand for concrete cloud products and
services — a managed database, an object store, a container platform — by a classification common to the
cloud providers, so that products of Microsoft Azure, Amazon Web Services, Google Cloud and others can be
compared and queried together. Two properties tag an element with a concept of the cloud services
taxonomy: its service category (compute, storage, databases…) and its service model (IaaS, PaaS,
SaaS). Trademarked names referenced herein are property of their respective owners."""@en;
